WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.342 --> 00:00:15.002
looked at Terrell.

2
00:00:15.022 --> 00:00:17.825
"I have to stop that monster."

3
00:00:17.845 --> 00:00:22.348
"See you later," Terrell mumbled before walking away.

4
00:00:22.368 --> 00:00:26.311
"That's odd," Roxy thought.

5
00:00:26.331 --> 00:00:28.433
"Terrell seems annoyed.

6
00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:29.734
I wonder why."

7
00:00:31.055 --> 00:00:31.656
She sighed.

8
00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:33.961
"I can't think about that now."

9
00:00:36.623 --> 00:00:38.544
A moment later she was flying over the city.

10
00:00:42.327 --> 00:00:46.530
Roar! An enormous monster stood between several tall buildings.

11
00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:49.952
"Whoa!" Roxy said.

12
00:00:49.972 --> 00:00:52.754
"That monster is huge!"

13
00:00:54.675 --> 00:00:57.077
In the streets below, people ran in every direction.

14
00:00:57.097 --> 00:00:59.539
"Look out!"

15
00:00:59.939 --> 00:01:00.960
a taxi driver shouted.

16
00:01:01.596 --> 00:01:02.816
"Run for your lives!"

17
00:01:03.217 --> 00:01:04.457
a construction worker yelled.

18
00:01:06.297 --> 00:01:08.798
Crash! Two cars hit each other.

19
00:01:09.918 --> 00:01:11.259
Roxy flew down fast.

20
00:01:11.279 --> 00:01:14.120
"Is everyone okay?"

21
00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:15.120
she asked.

22
00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:17.380
One driver gave her a thumbs-up.

23
00:01:18.461 --> 00:01:19.121
"I'm fine!"

24
00:01:19.501 --> 00:01:19.921
she said.

25
00:01:19.941 --> 00:01:22.182
"This car was old anyway."

26
00:01:23.282 --> 00:01:24.502
The other driver frowned.

27
00:01:24.522 --> 00:01:28.824
"Ugh! I spilled a mango smoothie all over myself!"

28
00:01:30.816 --> 00:01:31.357
He sighed.

29
00:01:31.377 --> 00:01:33.198
"But I'm okay."

30
00:01:34.599 --> 00:01:35.419
"Rocket Girl!"

31
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.880
Detective Smith shouted.

32
00:01:38.061 --> 00:01:40.643
Roxy saw the detective hiding behind a hot dog stand.

33
00:01:41.844 --> 00:01:42.725
She flew over to him.

34
00:01:42.745 --> 00:01:45.026
"Hi, Detective!"

35
00:01:45.346 --> 00:01:45.927
Roxy said.

36
00:01:45.947 --> 00:01:49.329
"I didn't know you worked at a hot dog stand."

37
00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:51.511
The detective frowned.

38
00:01:51.531 --> 00:01:54.633
"Very funny, Rocket Girl."

39
00:01:54.653 --> 00:01:57.735
"Do you know where the monster came from?"

40
00:01:58.055 --> 00:01:58.736
Roxy asked.

41
00:01:59.976 --> 00:02:02.277
"I have no idea," Detective Smith said.

42
00:02:03.558 --> 00:02:06.139
The hot dog stand owner popped up from behind the stand.

43
00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.900
"It just appeared suddenly!"

44
00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:11.561
"Huh?" Roxy said.

45
00:02:11.581 --> 00:02:14.683
"Everything was fine," the owner said.

46
00:02:14.703 --> 00:02:18.565
"Until I looked down to get a hot dog for a customer.

47
00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:21.826
When I looked back up, that monster was here!"

48
00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:30.815
Roar! The monster walked down the street as cars and buses swerved to avoid being hit.

49
00:02:32.776 --> 00:02:33.976
"Wait here, Detective!"

50
00:02:35.477 --> 00:02:37.358
Roxy flew after the enormous monster.

51
00:02:37.378 --> 00:02:41.060
"Hey! Stop right there!"

52
00:02:42.461 --> 00:02:43.822
The monster didn't seem to hear her.

53
00:02:44.802 --> 00:02:46.083
It kept walking slowly.

54
00:02:47.624 --> 00:02:49.725
Roxy got ready to fire her eye laser beams.

55
00:02:51.346 --> 00:02:53.708
But then a bus turned too fast and flipped over.

56
00:02:58.260 --> 00:03:01.782
Roxy shot back down to the street and lifted the bus back onto its wheels.

57
00:03:05.804 --> 00:03:06.705
Rocket Girl!"

58
00:03:07.525 --> 00:03:10.007
The bus driver slammed on the gas pedal and sped away.

59
00:03:12.508 --> 00:03:15.950
Roxy flew back up and saw the enormous monster swatting at helicopters.

60
00:03:17.411 --> 00:03:20.032
One helicopter swerved, and its tail bumped a building.

61
00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:25.055
The tail broke, smoke poured out, and the helicopter began to spiral down.

62
00:03:25.075 --> 00:03:30.273
"Yikes!" Roxy shot through the air and grabbed the helicopter with both hands.

63
00:03:30.293 --> 00:03:35.314
"Grr!" Roxy struggled to slow the helicopter down.

64
00:03:37.555 --> 00:03:40.176
Finally she brought it down safely in Metro City Park.

65
00:03:42.236 --> 00:03:43.957
The pilot wiped sweat from his forehead.

66
00:03:43.977 --> 00:03:45.737
"Thanks, Rocket Girl!"

67
00:03:46.898 --> 00:03:47.678
Roxy smiled.

68
00:03:47.698 --> 00:03:49.278
"No problem."

69
00:03:50.659 --> 00:03:52.159
She quickly flew back downtown.

70
00:03:53.579 --> 00:03:55.380
The monster headed down a wide street.

71
00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.982
As Roxy followed it, she noticed something odd.

72
00:04:00.002 --> 00:04:04.065
"That monster is moving silently," she thought.

73
00:04:04.085 --> 00:04:06.087
"I don't hear any stomping."

74
00:04:06.967 --> 00:04:07.888
Then she gasped.

75
00:04:09.409 --> 00:04:11.791
The monster's paw seemed to go right through a building.

76
00:04:12.872 --> 00:04:14.233
But the building looked fine.

77
00:04:15.394 --> 00:04:16.494
Roxy scratched her head.

78
00:04:16.514 --> 00:04:19.357
"Is the monster a hologram?"

79
00:04:20.858 --> 00:04:23.680
The monster was now walking toward the mountains outside the city.

80
00:04:26.004 --> 00:04:27.286
She followed it out of the city.

81
00:04:29.668 --> 00:04:31.630
Blink! It disappeared.

82
00:04:33.132 --> 00:04:35.074
Confused, Roxy looked all around.

83
00:04:37.576 --> 00:04:40.219
Then she saw a familiar alien superhero nearby.

84
00:04:40.239 --> 00:04:42.401
"Kid Comet!"

85
00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:43.402
Roxy shouted.

86
00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:45.465
Cozlin grinned.

87
00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:47.627
"Hey, Rocket Girl!"
